  "id": "GS-08",
  "title": "Config change points session-api at a decommissioned Redis",
  "narrative": "An engineer updated session-api's environment configuration and pasted the connection string of a Redis cache that was decommissioned last week. On Container Apps the update creates a new revision. Every session lookup now fails to connect after a 5-second timeout and returns 500. Activating the previous revision restores the old configuration.",
